SlateportCity_Harbor_Text_FlyToKanto::
    .string "Welcome to the SLATEPORT counter\n"
    .string "of the airline to KANTO!\p"
    .string "The flight lands at VERMILION\n"
    .string "AIRPORT. Would you like to board\l"
    .string "now?$"

SlateportCity_Harbor_Text_FlyWarning::
    .string "Flying around HOENN? Your POKéMON\n"
    .string "can take you to any town here\l"
    .string "you've set foot in.\p"
    .string "It won't cross to KANTO, mind.\n"
    .string "For that, board our plane.$"

SlateportCity_Harbor_Text_BadgeNone::
    .string "I keep the BADGE register for\n"
    .string "HOENN's eight GYMS.\p"
    .string "Your KANTO BADGES are your own\n"
    .string "business. Here you start at none.$"

SlateportCity_Harbor_Text_BadgeCount::
    .string "The register says… {STR_VAR_1} of\n"
    .string "HOENN's eight BADGES.$"

SlateportCity_Harbor_Text_BadgeKnuckle::
    .string "The KNUCKLE BADGE, out of DEWFORD\n"
    .string "TOWN.\p"
    .string "BRAWLY doesn't part with that one\n"
    .string "for a polite match.$"

SlateportCity_Harbor_Text_SternArrival::
    .string "So the KANTO plane does land here\n"
    .string "after all.\p"
    .string "STERN. I take the survey ship out\n"
    .string "of this harbor.\p"
    .string "Word came ahead of you, {PLAYER}.\n"
    .string "The one who took KANTO's LEAGUE.\p"
    .string "HOENN won't hand you anything for\n"
    .string "that, mind. The register man by\l"
    .string "the crates will tell you so.\p"
    .string "And if you want to know what this\n"
    .string "city is talking about, ask in the\l"
    .string "POKéMON CENTER. She writes it all\l"
    .string "down.$"

SlateportCity_Harbor_Text_SternMuseum::
    .string "My survey of the sea floor is on\n"
    .string "show upstairs in the OCEANIC\l"
    .string "MUSEUM.\p"
    .string "Go and look, if you like. Two men\n"
    .string "went up ahead of you who didn't\l"
    .string "pay much mind to the fish.$"

SlateportCity_Harbor_Text_SternThanks::
    .string "The survey is still in one piece,\n"
    .string "thanks to you.\p"
    .string "Win something in DEWFORD first.\n"
    .string "A HOENN BADGE, so the harbor knows\l"
    .string "who I'm sending out on my errands.$"

SlateportCity_Harbor_Text_SternAskScanner::
    .string "He's coming aboard? Then I'll say\n"
    .string "the rest of it.\p"
    .string "The ship we lost off ROUTE 108 had\n"
    .string "a SCANNER in the captain's office.\p"
    .string "Bring it up and the survey stops\n"
    .string "being guesswork.$"

SlateportCity_Harbor_Text_SternGotScanner::
    .string "That's it. Salt in every seam and\n"
    .string "it still reads.\p"
    .string "Take something from the hold for\n"
    .string "your trouble. Two things came up\l"
    .string "with it, and only one is yours.$"

SlateportCity_Harbor_Text_SternChoose::
    .string "The DEEPSEATOOTH, or the\n"
    .string "DEEPSEASCALE?\p"
    .string "Yes for the TOOTH, no for the\n"
    .string "SCALE. Take your time.$"

SlateportCity_Harbor_Text_ReceivedTooth::
    .string "{PLAYER} received the\n"
    .string "DEEPSEATOOTH!$"

SlateportCity_Harbor_Text_ReceivedScale::
    .string "{PLAYER} received the\n"
    .string "DEEPSEASCALE!$"

SlateportCity_Harbor_Text_SternAfterGift::
    .string "The other one stays in the hold\n"
    .string "until someone earns it.\p"
    .string "That's how a harbor works.$"

SlateportCity_Harbor_Text_SternNoRoom::
    .string "Your BAG won't take it. Come back\n"
    .string "when it will.$"

SlateportCity_Harbor_Text_SternDone::
    .string "We sail the blank water once the\n"
    .string "weather turns.\p"
    .string "Until then, HOENN is yours to walk\n"
    .string "about in.$"

SlateportCity_Harbor_Text_SternErrand::
    .string "Since you're standing there, do\n"
    .string "something for me.\p"
    .string "There's a man studying the rock in\n"
    .string "GRANITE CAVE, off DEWFORD. STEVEN.\l"
    .string "He reads stone the way I read\l"
    .string "charts.\p"
    .string "I want him to look at my survey\n"
    .string "before I take the ship out again.\p"
    .string "Tell him it's the blank stretch I\n"
    .string "want his opinion on. He'll know\l"
    .string "the one.$"

SlateportCity_Harbor_Text_SternErrandWaiting::
    .string "GRANITE CAVE, off DEWFORD TOWN.\n"
    .string "Take a light with you.\p"
    .string "STEVEN will be the only man down\n"
    .string "there who looks pleased about it.$"
